    "id": 2782,
    "name": "dead sea & himalayan MINERAL SCRUB",
    "type": "physical",
    "sku": "MS",
    "description": "<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">A mix of Dead Sea and Himalayan Salts with natural oils to soften, exfoliate and nourish dry skin.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">- 100%&nbsp;vegetarian&nbsp;ingredients.&nbsp;All our products are cruelty free... tested on friends, not animals.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">- No parabens or phthalates.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">- Packed in a mason jar with bamboo spoon in a cotton muslin bag.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">- To cleanse &amp; soften your skin: lightly apply, in a circular motion, to damp skin. For an added benefit, leave on your skin for several minutes before rinsing. Caution: may cause shower floor to become slippery.</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">- Size: 10oz/283g&nbsp;</span></p>\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">Ingredients: Dead Sea Salt, Himalayan&nbsp;Salt, Atlantic Sea Salt, Carthamus tinctorius (Safflower) Seed Oil, Cocos Nucifera (Coconut) Oil, Prunus Amygdalus Dulcis (Sweet Almond) Oil, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, Vegetable Glycerin, Tapioca Starch, Fragrance and Tocopherol (Vitamin E).</span></p>\r\n<div class=\"page\" title=\"Page 1\">\r\n<div class=\"section\">\r\n<div class=\"layoutArea\">\r\n<div class=\"column\">\r\n<p><span style=\"font-family: georgia, palatino; font-size: small; color: #3e3e3e;\">* This is a natural scrub with no preservatives added so please keep water out of the jar. A bamboo spoon is included to scoop out the scrub.</span></p>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>\r\n</div>",
